'''にゃんこ生態リポート極盛''' (''Nyanko Seitai Ripōto Goku Mori'', '''Nyanko Ecology Report Extreme Edition''') is a Japanese manga that was published on December 23rd, 2022 by [[wikipedia:Famitsu|Famitsu]].

