==Overview==
More than 900 kitten figures! This book is full of useful data for battles!

A large collection of various cats, from [[:Category:Normal Cats|basic]] to [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|legendary]] rarities.<br>
The book also includes data on each cat, such as their specialties, attack range, range, etc. If you check these data before you go into battle, you may be able to improve your chances of winning!<br>
The book is packed with useful information such as the [[True Form|third evolution]] ability and [[Cat Combo]] information!

※All information in this book is based on the game as of March 2022. Please note that there may be differences in the information posted due to updates and other factors after.

